Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HE0E2F2&\3c&H6261D0&\pos(10,206)}Warm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:57.51,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:15:59.91,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,S-Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.40,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\b1\shad0\c&HBBE1E2&\3c&H3B5CCA&\frz15.9\pos(347,128)}Fresh Squeezed Juice Blend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.53,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:07.90,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. I was having trouble deciding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:10.90,Main - Italics,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, that doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:15.74,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sure I could drink it,\Nso why don't you give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:19.93,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I'll buy you another one, \Nso please drink that instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:22.38,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,All right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.16,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:31.55,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Here. I, um... Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.58,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:39.68,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,This juice has a unique taste, so lots of \Nkids in class don't like it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.56,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{int}Is he trying to be more casual with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:44.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:45.81,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:51.12,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You can talk to me however\Nyou'd like. Don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:55.82,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,O-O-Oh... Okay! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, good... I, uh, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:04.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\b1\shad0\fay-.2\c&H879190&\3c&HE9F4EE&\move(447.385,56.462,430.385,59.924}2-4-6 Tea Blend
