Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:06.83,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku's grossing me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.98,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What? Is he doing something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:12.21,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right! Look at that grin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:12.96,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,1)\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs48\i1\pos(373,62)\c&H3730BC&\3c&HC6C7CB&}SLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:14.68,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,He slapped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:17.10,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku's pretty straightforward \Nwith his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.22,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He probably made up with Yanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:24.23,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Yanagin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:26.46,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Where are you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.02,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I'm returning to the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:31.72,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Not so fast! I told you to be\Ncasual with me, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:33.79,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Hey, you're laughing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:37.61,Main - Italics,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{int}If only I could play it\Nthis straight with Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:41.49,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Yanagin! Where are you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:46.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why are you being so stuffy? \NI told you we're friends, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.75,Main - Italics,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{int}No, Sengoku-kun's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.21,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Yanagin, are you gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.63,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:03.52,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I-I'm doing it, Iura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.60,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yeah, bring it on, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.60,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:11.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:14.09,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Hello, Ishikawa-kun and Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:16.99,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Iura-kun was saying he can \Ncatch a blade with his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.11,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:22.03,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I could've caught a katana if we had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You'd make a murderer of Yanagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:27.79,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You with me, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.87,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:33.83,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If I were to say I could catch a blade \Nbetween my hands like Iura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:36.76,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Would Yanagi do that to me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:37.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.23,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,M-Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.23,0:18:40.76,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.62,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,seems to attract cheerful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:49.02,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You mean airheads? Like Yoshikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:52.89,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If air... If cheerful people are \Neasier for him to get along with,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:54.32,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I guess I don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.28,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Why not be a cheerful airhead, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.36,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,When I saw her the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:00.91,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not listening, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.53,Flashback - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.04,Flashback,Yoshikawa,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.16,Flashback,Yoshikawa,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.14,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,She mistook the wall\Nfor a person and apologized?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.35,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I do that sometimes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:13.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.68,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've seen \Nsomeone glare at a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:23.15,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I don't think I can ever \Nbe like Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:24.49,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,Okay, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:24.69,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:25.93,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:26.93,Main - Top,Iura,0,0,0,,You caught it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:30.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,But if you acted more like Shu, \Nmaybe you could be friendlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:33.03,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You want me to act like Iura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.07,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's compromising too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:38.07,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I feel you, but he's better than Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:40.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'll show you what I mean. Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.75,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.64,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yanagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:44.20,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.68,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Side attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:48.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\fs20\c&H4D4E54&\pos(251,269)}Tickle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:48.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\fs20\c&H4D4E54&\pos(519,238)}Tickle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:48.20,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Akane's ticklish on \Nthe soles of his feet, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:49.69,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Now you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:50.89,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Me, do {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:52.58,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No! Nope! Never! No way! No how!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:55.72,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You idiot! You'll never \Naccomplish anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:57.38,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You want to be better friends \Nthan before, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:59.09,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You want to be better friends \Nthan now, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.11,0:20:02.17,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I need to practice first, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:05.09,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Why do you need a rehearsal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.10,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\c&H1C2418&\b1\frz20.92\move(476,232,469,230,0,1440)}Grab
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:09.66,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Stop! That was way too sensual!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:13.36,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That wasn't what I was expecting. \NWhat's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.80,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I don't have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.73,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:18.99,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It was like you were molesting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.17,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.74,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm glad we're rehearsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.43,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're a molester, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:26.99,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why do you pass by at \Nthe worst possible times?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:28.88,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Doing a little roleplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.66,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Sengoku's the molester.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:31.25,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:33.39,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then who are you, Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:34.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:38.50,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The casting's all wrong! \NAre we on a train or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:41.45,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,So the scene's Akane\N getting felt up on the train, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:43.01,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Who should I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:46.90,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I only wish I could be as dumb as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.93,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He actually called someone dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:51.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What's this all of a sudden? Bullying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:52.81,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:56.74,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun wants to get closer with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.75,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What? We're all already good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Is that not enough for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who thinks we're friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:06.16,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why do you look like your life's in danger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.28,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:08.74,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:10.54,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I can't believe your timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The president's kicking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.50,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What? The president's bullying someone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:15.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:19.56,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:23.55,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord1\fs16\c&H4D4E54&\pos(319,103)\3c&HF6F8F8&}Smile
