Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:23.55,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord1\fs16\c&H4D4E54&\3c&HF6F8F8&\pos(431,151)}Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.61,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You always take Sengoku-san's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:28.18,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,D-Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:30.88,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku and Yanagi really\Nare good friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:32.81,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{int}Could you be any more obvious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:36.68,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yanagi, Sengoku says he wants to be Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.57,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:40.63,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I like him the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.79,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What's this?! You want to be me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:47.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord4\an8\c&H2D323C&\fs36\3c&HE5E9EA&\b1}BEEEEAM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:46.70,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Let's start with a haircut!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:47.32,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I didn't mean the way you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:50.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,First a molester, then Iura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:52.08,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Talk about a busy day, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:56.71,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Molester?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.33,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No! That was a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:00.29,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Miyamura, come to the\N student council room later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:04.21,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,100)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord3\an6\c&H2D323C&\3c&HE5E9EA&\i1\b1}Yammer\NYammer\NYammer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Why? What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.77,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm angry at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:04.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:06.66,Main - Top,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{bg}You should know already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:08.73,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun and Sengoku-kun \Nget along great, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.73,Main - Top,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{bg}You just caused a lot of confusion!
